<p>You release a surge of adrenaline that increases your Physical Power by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Constitution 100">17, 22, 26, 29, 32</acronym> for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 6</acronym> turns. While the effect is active, you may continue to fight beyond the point of exhaustion.</p><p>You may continue to use stamina based talents while at zero stamina at the cost of life.</p><p>The Physical Power increase will scale with your Constitution.</p><p>Using this talent does not take a turn.</p>